Third-party software
--------------------
The licences of the third-party components that ship with the app are listed in
the generated file Apps/TheoNotesMac/Resources/Acknowledgements.json (shown in
the app under Acknowledgements) and, once the generator option exists, in the
generated THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md. Each component stays under its own licence.

Apple platforms
---------------
Tag icons are referenced by SF Symbols name (Packages/TheoNotesCore/Sources/TheoNotesCore/Resources/tagcons.json)
and rendered at runtime by the Apple system library. The symbols are not part of
this repository and are available on Apple platforms only. A port to another
platform needs its own icon set.
